{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":19,"ref":"2-chronicles 25:19","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"fr","chapter":25,"translation":"Tu as dit : Voici, tu as frappé ⟨את⟩ Édom, et ton cœur t'a porté à t'enorgueillir. Maintenant, reste dans ta maison. Pourquoi te provoquer dans le mal, pour que tu tombes, toi et Juda avec toi ?","tokens":[{"surface":"אמרת","gloss":"Tu as dit"},{"surface":"הנה","gloss":"Voici"},{"surface":"הכית","gloss":"tu as frappé"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"Édom"},{"surface":"אדום","gloss":"Édom"},{"surface":"ונשאך","gloss":"et ton cœur t'a porté"},{"surface":"לבך","gloss":"ton cœur"},{"surface":"להכביד","gloss":"à t'enorgueillir"},{"surface":"עתה","gloss":"Maintenant"},{"surface":"שבה","gloss":"reste"},{"surface":"בביתך","gloss":"dans ta maison"},{"surface":"למה","gloss":"Pourquoi"},{"surface":"תתגרה","gloss":"te provoquer"},{"surface":"ברעה","gloss":"dans le mal"},{"surface":"ונפלת","gloss":"et que tu tombes"},{"surface":"אתה","gloss":"toi"},{"surface":"ויהודה","gloss":"et Juda"},{"surface":"עמך","gloss":"avec toi"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-05T06:10:06.576285164Z","model":"glm-5.2"}